Under the Stars — credits

Lyrics: provided by the film's owner.
Original score (music/score.py), sound design (mix.py), animation and all drawings: generated by code in this
folder (numpy, Canvas 2D, WebGL). No samples, no stock art, no recorded vocal (the lead synth carries the melody).
Instrument DSP and the cel/CRT drawing engine adapted from the Lemo-Opuscar "80s Cel Anime" style library.

Fonts (SIL Open Font License 1.1, licence files in fonts/):
  Kanit (Cadson Demak), Barlow Semi Condensed (Jeremy Tribby), Dela Gothic One (artakana)
  source: https://github.com/google/fonts/tree/main/ofl

Style: inspired by 1980s Japanese cel animation in general; the character, places and story are original.
